       10; ReadImu; ReadClock} · ({CountStep; Beep; ShowNumberAt; 10} ·
       ((CountStep, [250, ∞)), (ReadImu, [0, 0], [0, 50], [0, 50])) ⊔ ...)`,
       which does not match its annotated grade `((CountStep, [250, ∞)),
       (ReadImu, [0, 0], [0, 50], [0, 50]))`
       ...
